What is it?

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
There's a firefight taking place in the hangar.

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
A team of assassins?

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
No, my lord. It's the UFE in Princess of Salem.

13
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
I will cover you.

14
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Now run!

15
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Eliminate all of those Terrans, now!

16
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Enemy attack! Enemy attack!

17
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Emergency launch, now.

18
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
That is not safe, my lord. There is a battle out there.

19
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,000
And one inside, too.

20
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Get us away from all combat zones at full emergency speed.

21
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Take cover!

22
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Come back, your highness.

23
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Inca, where is Princess of Salem?

24
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Inca, where is Princess of Salem?

25
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Still no word from her.

26
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Then she... didn't escape with you? Hold on.

27
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Mission is still complete. Inca, come pick me up, okay?

28
